            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/143ae7a6f9e11c9eed24a7fdb44bb40d442fd274ba01a2e3a4abe1596819bea2?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/crondaemon"
          },
          "resolved_at": "2020-12-27T19:00:41.289Z",
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 1479,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 474200454,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "@guyharris Done. Do you know why it is needed? The change seems to be trivial... Since I want to add support for some custom blocks in pcapng, I thought it might be good to figure out how the toolchain works...",
          "author": {
            "id": 6767546,
            "username": "tuexen",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Michael Tuexen",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d6f382382a0375d142fdc6a25b69adaf32966ecbc1ae250f74911166841f4d9c?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/tuexen"
          },
          "created_at": "2020-12-27T18:46:47.960Z",
          "updated_at": "2020-12-27T18:46:47.960Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 83015124,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": true,
          "resolved_by": {
            "id": 277876,
            "username": "crondaemon",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Dario Lombardo",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/143ae7a6f9e11c9eed24a7fdb44bb40d442fd274ba01a2e3a4abe1596819bea2?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/crondaemon"
          },
          "resolved_at": "2020-12-27T19:00:41.289Z",
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 1479,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 474203351,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "> Do you know why it is needed?\n\nThat check allows other core-devs to rebase your change. \"Allow commits from members\" sounded a bit puzzling to me as well, but basically the rationale is \"allow other members to add more commits (actually coming from master) to this MR\". It's needed because we have a ff-only policy active on the master.\n\nWithout that check, other cores (including gitlab bot) would require YOU to rebase the change instead of rebasing themselves.",
          "author": {
            "id": 277876,
            "username": "crondaemon",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Dario Lombardo",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/143ae7a6f9e11c9eed24a7fdb44bb40d442fd274ba01a2e3a4abe1596819bea2?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/crondaemon"
          },
          "created_at": "2020-12-27T18:58:55.076Z",
          "updated_at": "2020-12-27T18:58:55.076Z",
